# NOTE ON WHAT IS COMMITTED HERE.
# output/ holds full earnings-call transcript prose. The HuggingFace dataset card says MIT, but an
# earnings-call transcript is produced by a transcription provider and an uploader cannot license
# what it does not hold -- so the rights question is OPEN, every record is tagged
# `proprietary-review`, and the full build lives in cpt_corpus/held/, never in the manifest.
# The root .gitignore already excludes **/output/*.jsonl; this makes the intent local and explicit.
# A 3-record sample is committed for review -- internal inspection, NOT distribution.
output/earnings_calls_xbrl_cpt.jsonl
